OL,3,GNEWSASchool support staff to strike
OL,4,Aover pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 school support staff in
OL,7,Fsouth London are expected to strike on
OL,8,FFriday in a dispute over London
OL,9,Fweighting pay.
OL,11,FThe GMB union said workers from more
OL,12,Fthan 30 schools in Merton and Greenwich
OL,13,Fwould rally outside Parliament before
OL,14,Fmarching to the Department for
OL,15,FEducation (DfE) and on to Trafalgar
OL,16,FSquare.
OL,18,FTeaching assistants and other support
OL,19,Fstaff in the two boroughs are paid at
OL,20,Fouter London rates, while teachers at
OL,21,Fthe same schools receive inner London
OL,22,Fpay.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
